{
  "$comment": "Public pages under test. Single source for axe (tests/a11y.spec.ts) and Lighthouse (scripts/lighthouse.mjs). Each page is checked in every listed locale via ?lang=. /g/demo needs the demo seed (python -m app.cli seed-demo); the closure pages (ADR 0037) need python -m app.cli seed-closures > e2e/fixtures.json, which also resolves \"{name}\" paths. The widget pages (ADR 0035) are on the test host page of another origin, http://localhost:8001 (e2e/host/serve.mjs). The maintenance page (ADR 0038) closes every page, so it is checked in tests/maintenance.spec.ts, in its own CI step. The admin pages need a login at Keycloak as \"user\" and are checked by tests/admin-shell.spec.ts at phone, tablet and desktop width (SH-1), at desktop width (1280 px) also for content running past its box (e2e/layout.mjs); Lighthouse leaves them out. Booking pages (suspended booking, confirm, trial call) are opened by the emailed link /b/{token}, which sets the participant cookie and redirects to /b/m/{reference} (ADR 0093); the checks run on that final page, and the browser context keeps the cookie. The participant's journey around the video call (join link, the call, and the waiting room of a direct call, tests/direct-call.spec.ts) is not listed here: tests/video-journey.spec.ts walks it on the seeded journey bookings (fixtures.json, key journeys) with the simulator standing in for Webex.",
